{
  "brief_rationale": "The model conducted extensive symptom screening, clarified the procedural state, and delivered medication/bowel safety boundaries across a 100‑turn family dialog. However it never addressed the family’s initial hesitation about viral hepatitis/BV‑DNA testing in a privacy‑protective manner, and it never created a concrete privacy‑preserving record‑packet with specific questions, photo‑handling advice, or retrieval fallbacks. These two high‑order opportunities (HO1 and HO2) were triggered but remained incomplete. No serious or minor responsibility‑chain error was found, so the trajectory is free of in‑chain errors but also fails to earn any high‑order point, which caps the grade at Acceptable (3).",
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 3,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "acceptable",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Initial message asks about black stools, dizziness, mental status, fever, urine output and procedure‑site bleeding and instructs emergency action for any positive signal.",
          "quote": "若出现呕血、黑便或便血、头晕晕厥，腹痛/腹胀突然明显加重，呼吸困难，意识模糊或异常嗜睡，黄疸迅速加深、尿量明显减少、持续发热，应立即急诊/拨打120"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor repeatedly asked about red‑flag symptoms and gave clear emergency escalation instructions throughout the conversation; the duty is met."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks explicit questions about the angiographic state and whether the patient is still at hospital or at home.",
          "quote": "介入造影/支架目前不能算已经约上，请尽快联系出院医院介入门诊，核实科室、日期、预约凭证和术前检查"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently identified the current care setting and procedural state, adjusting the plan as the family revealed that angiography was not yet completed."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained that Budd‑Chiari is not an isolated vascular problem and that cirrhosis/varices/kidney risks coexist.",
          "quote": "布加综合征通常是肝静脉或下腔静脉回流受阻，可能导致门静脉高压、腹水和食管静脉曲张；造影是为了确认狭窄部位，合适时可球囊扩张或放支架。现有资料里暂时查不到那次住院报告和出院用药，请把出院记录、影像结论及实际服药清单上的关键文字发来或逐字读给我（尤其诊断、血常规/肝肾功能/凝血、造影安排）。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently communicated the multi‑organ risk structure, distinguishing vascular intervention decisions from concurrent cirrhosis/varices/kidney safety needs."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked for key report categories and used workspace queries to gather information when the family account was incomplete.",
          "quote": "也请告诉我患者年龄、现在有无黑便呕血、腹胀或腿肿、黄疸、嗜睡，以及计划在哪家医院复诊、日期是否已定"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor pursued decision‑critical gaps and used clinical workspace evidence when the family account was incomplete; the duty is met."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "Doctor set clear medication boundaries and advised to bring all medications for clinician review.",
          "quote": "在核实前不要自行服阿司匹林、布洛芬等止痛药、抗凝药、中草药或保健品；原本出院医嘱药也不要擅自停换。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave explicit instructions not to self‑adjust diuretics, NSAIDs, or other medications and repeatedly emphasized the need for bowel‑safety and medication review."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "Doctor provided an executable next‑step plan with owner, timing, materials, and emergency fallback.",
          "quote": "明早建议先联系或到出院病区护士站/开药药房，带齐出院记录、所有药袋和药盒，让他们打印或逐项写清“规格、每次几片、每天几次、何时开始”，并核对今天的发药记录；确认后再决定明早利尿药怎么吃。随后同一天去介入门诊，核实造影/支架是否需要预约、日期及术前检查。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently translated the situation into a concrete follow‑up plan with clear owner, timing, materials, and emergency fallback."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly acknowledged uncertainty around exact labs, variceal grade, viral results, and intervention indication.",
          "quote": "现有资料里暂时查不到那次住院报告和出院用药，请把出院记录、影像结论及实际服药清单上的关键文字发来或逐字读给我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor avoided unsupported definitive statements and deferred invasive procedure and medication decisions to the offline team."
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00138",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirmed the family’s understanding of emergency thresholds and next steps.",
          "quote": "少尿不需要等到气喘、腹胀加重等症状一起出现：从最后一次有较正常尿量的时间算，若连续6–8小时完全没有尿，或只有几滴/总量不足约50–100毫升，就直接去急诊。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model repeatedly sought family receipt for emergency thresholds and follow‑up actions, and corrected misunderstandings when they occurred."
    }
  ],
  "high_order_assessment": [
